        "story": "Garret is Caitlin's best friend, and not by coincidence. As the head of business development, he's Gregory's second-in-command, and he is always sharing insider information with Caitlin. As a person, he's like the human embodiment of an internet comments section. Caitlin can't suppress her grin when she spots our parade. I get it; this situation is her big break. I live for this from the other side of it. But right now, I'd love to remind her about the time she got drunk at our Christmas party two years ago and rubbed against the guy who was cutting ham slices at the buffet. Also, the party took place here in the office at three p.m.",
        "story_cn": "加勒特是凯特琳最好的朋友，这并非巧合。作为业务开发主管，他是格雷戈里的二把手，他总是与凯特琳分享内幕信息。作为一个人，他就像互联网评论部分的人类化身。当凯特琳看到我们的游行时，她忍不住笑了。我得到它;这种情况是她的重大突破。我从另一面为此而活。但现在，我很想提醒她，两年前她在我们的圣诞晚会上喝醉了，在自助餐上切火腿片的那个人身上蹭了蹭。此外，聚会于下午三点在办公室举行。",
