        "story": "He's speaking in low tones, but still, he needs to keep his voice down. I cannot physically crouch further into myself, and all the stares are churning my stomach. I don't respond. Instead I focus on some random child's demented art that a magnet holds to a filing cabinet behind Rhonda. This place really is in a sad state. The first red flag should have been during my interview, when Gregory said the company was \"like family.\" Cliff lingers. \"For what it's worth,\" he whispers, \"I will try and work with you where you're at, to make this as painless as possible. It'll just be constructive ways to get along with people.\" He grins again, like he's already laughing at the joke he's about to make.",
        "story_cn": "他说话的声音很低，但他仍然需要压低声音。我无法进一步蹲下，所有的目光都在搅动我的胃。我不回应。相反，我专注于一些随机的孩子疯狂的艺术，一块磁铁固定在朗达身后的文件柜上。这个地方确实处于悲伤的状态。第一个危险信号应该是在我接受采访时，格雷戈里说公司“就像家人一样”。悬崖徘徊。 “无论如何，”他低声说道，“我会尽力在你所处的位置与你合作，让这件事尽可能轻松。这只是与人相处的建设性方式。”他又笑了，好像他已经为自己即将讲的笑话笑了。",
