        "story": "My first mistake was not packing a change of pants. The ones I'm wearing are wrinkled from a day of sitting in an office, and as I make my way over it's like a runway of shame to a row of harsh judges. Aunty Miriam spots me first and gives me a look that's somehow proud and disapproving at the same time. Aunty Miriam is the only aunty here who's actually my aunt. In the Persian aunty network, there's a series of women in every corner of the world who are either vaguely related to me or close family friends. If I were to vacation in Antarctica, my mom would tell me to check in with an aunty there or face certain public shaming. Today Aunty Miriam is sporting aggressively dark eyeshadow and a designer handbag that's so sleek and sharp, it could be wielded as a weapon. She nudges my mom, who is seated beside her, and mutters something -- a lovely comment about me, I'm sure.",
        "story_cn": "我的第一个错误是没有带换洗的裤子。我穿的衣服因为在办公室坐了一天而变得皱巴巴的，当我穿过它时，它就像是对一排严厉的法官来说的耻辱跑道。米里亚姆阿姨首先发现了我，她用一种既自豪又不以为然的眼神看着我。米里亚姆阿姨是这里唯一的阿姨，实际上是我的阿姨。在波斯阿姨网络中，有一系列遍布世界各个角落的女性，她们要么与我有隐约的关系，要么是亲密的家庭朋友。如果我要去南极洲度假，我妈妈会告诉我去那里的阿姨那里办理入住手续，否则就会面临公众羞辱。如今，米里亚姆阿姨涂着浓浓的深色眼影，手上拎着一款时尚、犀利的名牌手提包，简直可以当作武器来使用。她碰了碰坐在她旁边的妈妈，嘟囔了一些什么——我确信这是对我的可爱评论。",
