        "story": "It's all boring stuff, confirmations for Gregory's appointments and budget grids. There's one odd thing sitting there, though: From: Rhonda Staples To: Rhonda Staples Subject: Summary for Month April 1: Late by 7 minutes April 5: 12-minute phone conversation with Elite Sneakers April 16: Returned from lunch 1:16 pm April 17: 27-minute conversation in copy room: various people April 20: Spent 17 mins staring at screensaver. Also 14 mins staring at his own hands. April 25: Morning researching all-season tires April 27: Detoured on way to bathroom to have 12-minute conversation with Larry Goodwin Is she tracking someone's schedule? As if on cue, she turns abruptly, sweeps her hands together, and declares, \"There, so much fresher.\" She riffles through the Rolodex she's been using since Bob Barker was a baby, a dreadful indication that she's about to make a loud phone call that most certainly should be an email. And of course, Rhonda yells into her receiver, \"Hello, Marianne! How's things?\" She cackles at whatever Marianne's response was, then narrows her eyes as Armin stumbles to his desk. He's all giant headphones, bass blaring, with hair still wet and some generic \"fresh\" men's body wash scent stinking up the air around us.",
        "story_cn": "这些都是无聊的东西，确认格雷戈里的约会和预算表格。不过，那里有一件奇怪的事情： 来自：Rhonda Staples 至：Rhonda Staples 主题：月份摘要 4 月 1 日：迟到 7 分钟 4 月 5 日：与 Elite Sneakers 进行 12 分钟的电话交谈 4 月 16 日：下午 1:16 吃完午饭回来 4 月 17 日：在复印室进行 27 分钟的谈话：不同的人 4 月 20 日：花了 17 分钟盯着屏幕保护程序。还有14分钟盯着自己的手。 4 月 25 日：早上研究全季节轮胎 4 月 27 日：绕道去洗手间与拉里·古德温 (Larry Goodwin) 进行 12 分钟的交谈 她是否在跟踪某人的日程安排？仿佛得到了暗示，她突然转身，双手合十，说道：“好了，新鲜多了。”她翻阅着鲍勃·巴克（Bob Barker）还是个婴儿时就一直使用的名片盒，这是一个可怕的迹象，表明她即将大声打电话，而这肯定应该是一封电子邮件。当然，朗达对着听筒大喊：“你好，玛丽安！怎么样？”不管玛丽安的反应是什么，她咯咯地笑起来，然后当阿明跌跌撞撞地走向他的办公桌时，她眯起了眼睛。他戴着巨大的耳机，低音刺耳，头发还湿着，我们周围的空气中弥漫着一些普通的“新鲜”男士沐浴露的气味。",
