        "beatId": 25,
        "story": "He's about to clear my area when he stops and turns abruptly toward me. \"Miss Smith, has your interpersonal training started?\" He says it loud enough for half the floor to hear, which means Caitlin and Larry, who are walking toward the pods, look my way -- wide-eyed imbeciles. \"I have my first session today,\" I mutter. \"That's wonderful.\" Gregory smiles like the proud Papa Bear he is. \"We want you to do as well as possible. Soon this whole nonsense will be behind us.\" \"Yes,\" I reply, still staring straight ahead. I'll never be able to look this man in the eye again. He takes a few strides forward, then stops and says, \"Have you seen that email?\" I stop breathing.",
        "story_cn": "当他停下来并突然转向我时，他正要清理我的区域。 “史密斯小姐，你的人际交往训练开始了吗？”他的声音足以让半个地板都听到，这意味着朝吊舱走去的凯特琳和拉里朝我这边看去——睁大眼睛的傻瓜。 “我今天有第一堂课，”我嘀咕道。 “那太好了。”格雷戈里微笑着，就像骄傲的熊爸爸一样。 “我们希望你做得尽可能好。很快这一切废话就会被我们抛在脑后。” “是的，”我回答道，仍然直视前方。我再也无法直视这个男人的眼睛了。他向前走了几步，然后停下来说：“你看到那封电子邮件了吗？”我停止呼吸。",
