        "story": "But then Cliff locks eyes with me and his expression brightens. \"Jolene, hey!\" All my pity for him vanishes in an instant. I catch Caitlin smirking, and she shifts her gaze from Cliff to me. My skin tightens as more eyes tilt in my direction. I give Cliff a small, curt nod. I can't even muster a smile. He doesn't seem to register the vibes I'm giving off, because he makes his way to my desk and leans an arm against my cubicle wall. The sweet scent that permeated his office has followed him here, and everything in me seems to liquefy.",
        "story_cn": "但随后克里夫与我目光对视，他的表情变得明亮起来。 “乔琳，嘿！”我对他的所有怜悯瞬间消失殆尽。我发现凯特琳在傻笑，她把目光从克里夫身上转移到了我身上。随着越来越多的目光转向我的方向，我的皮肤绷紧了。我简短地向克里夫点了点头。我什至无法微笑。他似乎没有注意到我所发出的共鸣，因为他走到我的办公桌前，将一只手臂靠在我的隔间墙上。办公室里弥漫的甜甜的香味也跟着他来到了这里，我身上的一切似乎都被液化了。",
