        "beatId": 15,
        "story": "I stand very still. Finally, he sucks in a breath and says, \"Would it be crazy to ask you to pretend to be my fiancée one more time? Maybe a dinner or something? My mom won't stop asking me, and it'd make her really happy.\" My head shake is so automatic and aggressive, it makes me dizzy. \"Last night was honestly a fluke. I can't pull that off again.\" \"I could talk you through what to say!\" he insists, eyes giant and pleading. \"Or I'll handle most of the talking, and you can enjoy a free meal. The hardest part would be pretending to like me for a bit,\" he adds with a small, teasing smile.",
        "story_cn": "我一动不动地站着。最后，他吸了一口气，说道：“让你再假装是我的未婚妻是不是太疯狂了？也许是一顿晚餐什么的？我妈妈不会停止问我，这会让她真的很高兴。”我的摇头是如此自动且具有攻击性，这让我感到头晕。 “昨晚确实是一次侥幸。我再也无法成功了。” “我可以告诉你该说什么！”他坚持道，眼睛睁得大大的，充满恳求。 “或者我会处理大部分的谈话，你可以享受一顿免费的饭菜。最困难的部分是假装喜欢我一点，”他带着一丝戏弄的微笑补充道。",
