        "story": "Larry stands, shiny sheen on his forehead, armpits darkened and heavy from perspiration. \"Good god,\" comes from some unknown voice in the back. My breath halts in involuntary sympathy as he clears his throat. \"I think we should implement some type of town hall meeting every now and then to really form a cohesive office.\" He stares at Gregory, an intense smile pointed toward him like an attack. \"We could share ideas and go over some of the bigger elements that affect multiple departments.\" Did he just suggest the very thing we're doing? My eyes draw to Cliff, who is wincing and nodding along. He writes something down, lips pressed together. Larry grins like he really said something there and lingers while a tumbleweed passes.",
        "story_cn": "拉里站着，额头上闪闪发亮，腋窝因出汗而变得又黑又重。 “天啊，”后面传来一个陌生的声音。当他清清喉咙时，我的呼吸不由自主地停止了。 “我认为我们应该时不时地召开某种类型的市政厅会议，以真正形成一个有凝聚力的办公室。”他盯着格雷戈里，一个强烈的微笑指向他，就像一种攻击。 “我们可以分享想法并讨论一些影响多个部门的更大因素。”他刚刚建议了我们正在做的事情吗？我的目光转向克里夫，他皱着眉头，点点头。他嘴唇抿在一起，写下了一些东西。拉里咧嘴一笑，好像他真的在那里说了些什么，并在风滚草经过时逗留不去。",
