        "beatId": 4,
        "story": "\"Man, what are the odds?\" He takes a step back, looking me over from head to toe. \"I mean, if I'd known it was you, I would've warned Caity.\" He makes a cross with his fingers, laughing again as he holds it up at me. And it's like time travel. I'm seventeen again, and I'm drunk, and we're at the party at Stanley Park. And Kyle is tormenting Ellie, holding up his fingers in a cross and shouting, \"Get away, loser.\" And Ellie is pulling on my wrist and saying we should go, but I shrug her off because he's not saying it to me. And because for once, before Kyle came, it felt like I belonged. Because I thought we were actually enjoying drinking random liquor from Solo cups. So I take another drink as Ellie takes off into the forest.",
        "story_cn": "“老兄，可能性有多大？”他后退一步，从头到脚打量着我。 “我的意思是，如果我知道是你，我就会警告凯蒂。”他用手指画了一个十字，然后举起它对着我，再次大笑起来。这就像时间旅行。我又回到了十七岁，我喝醉了，我们正在斯坦利公园参加聚会。凯尔正在折磨艾莉，将手指交叉并大喊：“走开，失败者。”艾莉拉着我的手腕说我们该走了，但我耸耸肩，因为他没有对我这么说。因为这一次，在凯尔到来之前，我感觉到了归属感。因为我认为我们实际上很享受用 Solo 杯子随意喝酒。于是，当艾莉飞进森林时，我又喝了一杯。",
