        "story": "But he drops it quickly. \"Are you sure you're okay, Jolene?\" It's the way his brows knit together, the sorrow in his eyes, that clues me in that he's not just talking about Larry. \"I'm fine.\" The unease builds in me, heavy and draining. I just want Cliff back. \"Are you okay? I mean after that.\" The edge of his jaw is bright red beneath his long stubble where Larry clocked him. I lift a hand to -- I don't know, gesture toward it, touch it, I'm not sure -- and then pull it back down just as quickly. He notices the motion and his temples pinken.",
