        "beatId": 7,
        "story": "He's HR, after all. \"I'd like to try that too,\" he continues. He smiles at me, a small plea in his eyes. I blink, but I'm too frozen to do more. We haven't been this close to each other since the movies, the fire alarm -- all our recent half-finished messy conversations -- and I don't know what to with any part of my body. I'd been planning to call in sick on the day of our next session, hoping that I could somehow pass the course without seeing him again. I should say at least one casual thing to him, but I don't know what, and more relevantly, I can't. The idea of showing any human emotion, especially in front of the entire office and especially Caitlin, makes me want to actually dissolve into the blender that's mixing margaritas in a loud drone at the bar.",
        "story_cn": "毕竟他是人力资源部。 “我也想尝试一下，”他继续说道。他对我微笑，眼里带着一丝恳求。我眨了眨眼，但我太僵硬了，无法再做更多的事情。自从电影、火警警报——我们最近所有半完成的混乱谈话——之后我们就没有这么靠近过——我不知道该怎么处理我身体的任何部分。我本来计划在下次课程的那天请病假，希望我能以某种方式通过课程而不再见到他。我至少应该对他说一件随意的事情，但我不知道说什么，更重要的是，我不能。展现任何人类情感的想法，尤其是在整个办公室，尤其是凯特琳面前，让我想真正融入搅拌机中，在酒吧里用大声的嗡嗡声混合玛格丽塔酒。",
