        "story": "It means everything to me.\" A reel of memories plays behind my eyes of us through the years, sitting a few feet across from each other, both angry about the other person, both ashamed of ourselves. It's hard to believe how similar we are. \"I know exactly what you mean.\" Then I let out an empty chuckle. \"I can't see how this company could lay either of us off when we're the only two that could fix this bullshit tonight.\" \"Yeah. Good point.\" She almost laughs, though it dies in her throat. The distinct squeal of a bus approaches and rounds the corner, casting its headlights over us. \"I think that's the twelve,\" Caitlin says, looking at me guiltily. \"Will you be okay out here?\" I check my phone.",
        "story_cn": "这对我来说意味着一切。” 这些年来，我们的记忆在我眼前浮现，我们彼此相距几英尺，都对对方感到愤怒，都为自己感到羞耻。很难相信我们有多么相似。“我完全明白你的意思。”然后我轻笑了一声。“当我们是今晚唯一能解决这个问题的两个人时，我不明白这家公司怎么可能解雇我们中的任何一个。” “是的。说得好。”她差点笑出声来，但笑到了喉咙里。一辆公共汽车发出清晰的尖叫声，驶过街角，将车头灯投射在我们身上。“我想那是十二点了，”凯特琳说，内疚地看着我。“你在这儿还好吗？”我查看手机。",
